}

docs {
  # Stats Overview (admin)

  Totals, bookings by status, flats by category/area, and 12 months of activity.

  **Example `data` shape**

  ```json
  {
    "totals": {
      "users": 12,
      "owners": 3,
      "flats": 15,
      "availableFlats": 12,
      "bookings": 8,
      "pendingBookings": 2,
      "reviews": 5,
      "averageRent": 35000
    },
    "bookingsByStatus": [{ "status": "pending", "count": 2 }],
    "flatsByCategory": [{ "category": "family", "count": 8 }],
    "flatsByArea": [{ "area": "Dhanmondi", "count": 3, "averageRent": 38000 }],
    "monthlyActivity": [{ "month": "2026-09", "signups": 2, "listings": 1, "bookings": 3 }]
  }
  ```
}
